== a verb's arguments, checked as a script line is
  capture {} -> {"file":"capture-3.png","scale":1}  problem []
  capture named -> {"file":"mine.png","scale":2}
  capture ../x.png -> capture file must be a plain name in the output directory, with no /
  capture scale 9 -> capture scale must be at most 8
  raise sideways -> raise pane must be one of results, branch, tables, git, agent
  caret_to {} -> caret_to needs "text"
  open_window main -> open_window: the main window is always open
  shot_script {x} -> shot_script takes no arguments
  shot_script {} -> []
== the run wait
  [] -> 30
  [soon] -> 30
  [0] -> 30
  [-2] -> 30
  [2.5] -> 2.5
  [45] -> 45
  unset -> 30
